{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoner's Pieces</strong> is a new kind of competitive game that fuses <br><strong>puzzle mechanics</strong>, <strong>deck-building</strong>, and <strong>auto-battler</strong> elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/9c31429958913791d8957056b9cdcf2a.poster.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/9c31429958913791d8957056b9cdcf2a.webm?t=1759205153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/9c31429958913791d8957056b9cdcf2a.mp4?t=1759205153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drag pieces from your hand onto the summoning board. When all the tabs (\u51f8) on a piece are successfully connected, the unit or spell sealed within that piece is summoned onto the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Piece Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more tabs a piece has, the harder it is to summon \u2014 but the stronger it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/30d5df4783753fbd8f6685d6b274903f.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=201 /></span>If your deck is filled only with powerful pieces, it will be difficult to summon them. Make sure to balance your deck with weaker pieces too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces come in five elemental colors, each with unique tab-and-slot shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/ceb9e393f936afe05859bd1030d28b49.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also neutral pieces with no elemental attribute. They consist of common shapes only, making them easier to include in any deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/292481c7335ae9f972ef269d643469dd.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some pieces are spell pieces that activate an effect immediately when summoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/b92aa5b1ff9b156502e27c98e09d1f4f.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Auto-Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once summoned, units with various abilities will automatically battle each other. The player who eliminates all opposing units wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/5d0ad4ad4b248e36836e3f531459cdde.poster.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/5d0ad4ad4b248e36836e3f531459cdde.webm?t=1759205153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/5d0ad4ad4b248e36836e3f531459cdde.mp4?t=1759205153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is \u201csolve the puzzle to summon\u201d \u2014 no need to learn complex rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get used to the game, you\u2019ll discover deeper strategies through timing your placements and building your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place a Piece\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Drag a piece onto the summoning board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect All Tabs\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Once all tabs are connected, the sealed unit or spell is summoned</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Battle</strong> \u2013 Summoned units fight automatically; the player who eliminates all opposing units wins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friend Battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CPU Stages / CPU Battles</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837370?t=1759205153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/fc183bc019bf302c7c2ef7672fca60fb7cd1b516/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759205153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/875bcc535d90b71e9e65dbc917c20dc82d7d3c61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759205153","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/875bcc535d90b71e9e65dbc917c20dc82d7d3c61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759205153","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4039060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summoner's Pieces</strong> is a new kind of competitive game that fuses <br><strong>puzzle mechanics</strong>, <strong>deck-building</strong>, and <strong>auto-battler</strong> elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/9c31429958913791d8957056b9cdcf2a.poster.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/9c31429958913791d8957056b9cdcf2a.webm?t=1759205153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/9c31429958913791d8957056b9cdcf2a.mp4?t=1759205153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Drag pieces from your hand onto the summoning board. When all the tabs (\u51f8) on a piece are successfully connected, the unit or spell sealed within that piece is summoned onto the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Piece Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more tabs a piece has, the harder it is to summon \u2014 but the stronger it becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/30d5df4783753fbd8f6685d6b274903f.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=201 /></span>If your deck is filled only with powerful pieces, it will be difficult to summon them. Make sure to balance your deck with weaker pieces too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pieces come in five elemental colors, each with unique tab-and-slot shapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/ceb9e393f936afe05859bd1030d28b49.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also neutral pieces with no elemental attribute. They consist of common shapes only, making them easier to include in any deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/292481c7335ae9f972ef269d643469dd.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some pieces are spell pieces that activate an effect immediately when summoned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/b92aa5b1ff9b156502e27c98e09d1f4f.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Auto-Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once summoned, units with various abilities will automatically battle each other. The player who eliminates all opposing units wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/5d0ad4ad4b248e36836e3f531459cdde.poster.avif?t=1759205153\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/5d0ad4ad4b248e36836e3f531459cdde.webm?t=1759205153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/extras/5d0ad4ad4b248e36836e3f531459cdde.mp4?t=1759205153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you need to do is \u201csolve the puzzle to summon\u201d \u2014 no need to learn complex rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you get used to the game, you\u2019ll discover deeper strategies through timing your placements and building your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rules</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place a Piece\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Drag a piece onto the summoning board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect All Tabs\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Once all tabs are connected, the sealed unit or spell is summoned</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto Battle</strong> \u2013 Summoned units fight automatically; the player who eliminates all opposing units wins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friend Battles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CPU Stages / CPU Battles</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["flow Inc.","tackgames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837370/93fc221a091a64a4c4894a3516f951a642f5548e/header.jpg?t=1759205153","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 flow Inc., tackgames","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 (Catalina)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i3 (2 cores)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 integrated GPU\u2003/\u2003Intel UHD 630 (Metal capable)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3837370/1644252479/a85a3e3de5f516c5b4c5c1848e4175a1e250c0f9/1753671940/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753672766","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3837370/1644252479/a85a3e3de5f516c5b4c5c1848e4175a1e250c0f9/1753671940/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753672766","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3837370/1644252479/a85a3e3de5f516c5b4c5c1848e4175a1e250c0f9/1753671940/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753672766","id":257172106,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172106/movie480.mp4?t=1753672766","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172106/movie_max.mp4?t=1753672766"},"name":"First trailer (en)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257172106/621c35be9d58da0b96063b90d6ebbee627d55bf7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753672766","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172106/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753672766","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257172106/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753672766"}}],"name":"Summoner's Pieces","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4160\uff0fAMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pr